Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.71,0:00:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,船长要你把船保持在五百尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain wants you to keep 500 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.28,0:01:01.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,指挥部呼叫驾驶舱 升到五百尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maneuvering, Control. Come in shallow to 500 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.05,0:01:06.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 保持五百尺 - 保持五百尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep 500 feet. - Keep 500 feet, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.58,0:01:39.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's going on, Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:44.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧急状态 船长请到指挥部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emergency stations. Captain to the control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:48.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么了?  - 5号舱壁关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on? - Number five bulkhead shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:51.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 驾驶舱叫指挥部 - 控制室 我是船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Control, Maneuvering. - Control, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.13,0:01:54.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电频率中断了 我要把系统切断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm losing electrical frequency. I'll have to break down the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,测量室呼叫指挥部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Control, Sound Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.67,0:02:02.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,声纳设备丧失动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Total loss of power on all sonar sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:04.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浮出水面 全速浮出水面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surface. Blow forward, blow aft, full ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全速浮出水面 开动探测潜望镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full rise on both planes. Raise the search periscope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.63,0:02:31.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把电话接进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, put him through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.84,0:02:33.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.14,0:02:36.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 海军大臣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, First Sea Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前还没有漫游者号的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been no contact with Ranger yet, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.48,0:02:42.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看不见它 也没收到危难讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sightings, no distress signals, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:45.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks very much like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.78,0:02:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, of course I will, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.22,0:02:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们损失了一艘核潜艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've lost one of our nuclear submarines.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.29,0:02:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(莫斯科)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:03:00.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波特金号潜艇神秘失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The submarine Potempkin disappeared without trace?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:08.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直是大灾难 主席同志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a catastrophe, Comrade Chairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 我会立刻派遣最好的特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, of course. I'll assign our best agent immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:20.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 鲁贝威区 特工3X在哪? - 在休假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rubelvitch, where is Agent XXX? - On leave, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.95,0:03:23.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在人民休养康复中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At a people's rest and recuperation center.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.46,0:03:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个周未真愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a wonderful weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.97,0:03:40.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我永远不会忘记 - 我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I shall never forget it. - Nor will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:42.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们何时会再见面?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When can we meet again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.44,0:03:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到我的任务完成后即可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as my mission is accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.01,0:03:52.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要是了 我今晚要到达奥地利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must go. I have to be in Austria tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:53.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再躺五分钟吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:04.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,3X,呼叫3X\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent XXX. Calling Agent XXX.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.26,0:04:06.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你马上到总部报到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will report to headquarters immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:09.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,3X 请答话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent XXX, acknowledge and verify.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:22.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是3X 讯息收到 明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is XXX. Message received and understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.15,0:04:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 首相大人 我明白事态的严重性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Mr. Prime Minister. I understand the gravity of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:30.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会马上调遣最好的特工出动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I'll put our best man on it at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.45,0:04:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:42.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钱班儿?007在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moneypenny, where is 007?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.47,0:04:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在奥地利执行任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on a mission, sir, in Austria.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫他立刻撤出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him to pull out, immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.61,0:05:00.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯 我找不到语言去形容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, James, I cannot find the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:04.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我帮你找一个适合的词语吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me try and enlarge your vocabulary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:24.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(007马上向总部报到)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.41,0:05:29.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.91,0:05:32.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要到哪去? - 对不起 出了事情了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are you going? - Sorry, darling. Something came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, James, I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:42.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,英国也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So does England.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:54.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他刚刚离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.80,0:05:56.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通话完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:59.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到了 我们在等他 通话完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Message received. We are waiting. Over and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.79,0:06:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.06,0:08:40.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《007系列之海底城》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.33,0:10:53.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫3X进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send in Agent XXX.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.78,0:11:05.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将军同志 你找我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sent for me, Comrade General.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.31,0:11:09.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安 阿玛索娃少校 我们正面对一个棘手的局面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning. Major Amasova, we are facing a most delicate situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:13.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的核潜艇完全失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our nuclear submarine Potempkin has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:14.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被破坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sabotage?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就有待你去调查 我们有一个线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is for you to find out. We have one lead:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在开罗有个联络人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A connection in Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.36,0:11:21.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You leave tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.86,0:11:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有别的事情了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will that be all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.07,0:11:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很遗憾 特工西凯尔波索夫殉职了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I regret to inform you, Major, that Agent Sergei Borzov has been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:43.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在奥地利阿雨卑斯山的伯加顿执行任务时遇害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On a mission at Berngarten in the Austrian Alps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.45,0:11:47.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是不幸的事件 将军同志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A tragic occurrence, Comrade General.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:50.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道你跟波索夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It had not escaped our notice that you and Agent Borzov...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:53.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不只是朋友的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had been more than friends for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.03,0:11:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:57.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他时怎样死的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did he die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:11:58.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,详细情况还不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We haven't all the details yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:12:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是跟英国的情报组织有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears he'd become involved in a British Secret Service operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如有任何消息 请你通知我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please keep me informed, Comrade General.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很希望跟那个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should very much like to meet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.11,0:12:11.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他杀死的人见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whoever was responsible for his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 早安 - 早安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning, sir. - Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:42.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 早安 007 - 你好 Q\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning, 007. - Hello, Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 任务成功吗 - 马马虎虎吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mission successful? - On and off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.48,0:12:47.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 早安 中校 - 早安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning, Commander. - Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:50.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 福斯夫上校 - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Captain Forsyth. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.55,0:12:52.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是邦德中校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander Bond, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:54.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 国访部长佛雷克葛瑞 - 早安中校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Fredrick Gray, Minister of Defense. - Good morning, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.82,0:12:57.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜艇舰队同令哈尔盖里夫上将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral Hargreaves, Flag Officer, Submarines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:13:00.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是皇家方舟号吧 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ark Royal, wasn't it? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.33,0:13:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- M把情况告诉你了吧? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I believe M told you about this. - Yes, Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.63,0:13:05.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请各位到这边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here, please, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.36,0:13:28.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(位置  路线)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:35.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是漫游者号预定的巡航范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This, I take it, is Ranger's prearranged coastal patrol area.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.93,0:13:39.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗯 - 有多少人知道这条路线?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's right. - How many people knew this course?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.83,0:13:41.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈尔盖里夫上将 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral Hargreaves, myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:43.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有潜艇的船长泰博特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Talbot, the submarine captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:54.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:13:59.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是从什么地方得来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did this come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.25,0:14:01.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 这是目前的高度机密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Benson. For the moment, that's top secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.55,0:14:04.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了 这条追踪路线表示…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see, sir. Commander, this tracing means...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:09.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏联人可以追踪水中的棱子潜艇 并把它击沉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the Russians can track our nuclear submarines underwater and sink them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.56,0:14:12.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我相信他们已经做到了 - 怎么做到的?这是不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I believe it does. - How could they? It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.80,0:14:15.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实很简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:19.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最可能的是热能识别法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heat signature recognition, most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.71,0:14:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我可以解释吗 - 当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- With your permission, Minister? - Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.87,0:14:23.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:26.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装有红外线热能感应器的卫星…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We already know that satellites with infrared heat sensors...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:29.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以凭着导弹尾部的火光追踪导弹的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can detect a nuclear missile in flight by its tail fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:31.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:34.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人可以探测潜艇的尾波\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone can now locate a submerged nuclear submarine...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.72,0:14:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以确定潜艇的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in exactly the same way, by its wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.23,0:14:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说 他们可以暗中破坏西方的防卫战略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means they can totally undermine our Western defense strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.43,0:14:44.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:48.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这份系统图是从哪里来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did we get that tracing, Freddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从开罗寄来的外交信袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cairo, diplomatic bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人想出售追踪系统图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody got the plans of that tracking system and is trying to sell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.77,0:14:57.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把路线图送来证明系统是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They sent us that tracing as proof that it's genuine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.68,0:15:00.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若要跟他交易 价钱将会很昂贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, if there is a deal to be made, the price will be high.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.71,0:15:03.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高昂? 历直是天文数字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"High?" Astronomical.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失踪了的潜艇装有十六枚导弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That missing submarine had 16 Polaris missiles aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:11.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在埃及有联络人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a contact in Egypt?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.39,0:15:14.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,M会把详情告诉你 你今晚出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M will give you the details. You leave tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:27.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴哈曼博士 马柯堆兹教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Bechmann and Professor Markovitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:29.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.61,0:15:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是该跟两位道别的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, now that the moment has come to bid you farewell...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:36.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我恭喜你们两位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I congratulate both you, Doctor, and you, Professor...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.52,0:15:39.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭着你们的努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on your brilliant work in the development...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.65,0:15:42.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功开发出潜艇追踪系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the submarine tracking system.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.09,0:15:45.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你们的努力下 我很高兴的说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks primarily to you, I'm happy to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:47.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行动的第一阶段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the first phase of our operation...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:50.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,获得重大成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has met with considerable success.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:52.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经吩咐助手...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have instructed my assistant...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:54.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你们的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to have paid into your...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.63,0:15:56.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞士银行户口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swiss bank account...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:16:00.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分别存入一千万美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the sum of $10 million each.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.21,0:16:02.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 - 非常谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you, sir. - Thank you, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的合作就到此为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that, I think, concludes our business.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.85,0:16:09.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 在你们离开之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you go, however...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.18,0:16:11.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾要告诉你们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I very much regret to inform you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.85,0:16:13.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发觉事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that a dangerous development...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.82,0:16:16.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现了危险的变故\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has recently been brought to my notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.79,0:16:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人尝试把追踪系统计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone has been attempting to sell the plans...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:22.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出售给…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of our tracking project...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.19,0:16:24.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们敌对的强国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to competing world powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:27.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人跟这个计划的关系密切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone intimately associated with the project.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:32.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 请你先行离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear, it would be more seemly if you left us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:34.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:06.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你背叛了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was you who betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.04,0:17:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你取得了所有的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had access to all the information.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:12.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你要接受惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you will pay the penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:41.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再次致以衷心的感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once again, gentlemen, my most profound thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.62,0:19:03.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 山多尔 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sandor. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.26,0:19:08.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大钢牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我派你去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm assigning you the task...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.46,0:19:14.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找回追踪系统的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of recovering the microfilm copy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.77,0:19:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,微缩影片拷贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the tracking system.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:21.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山多尔 你跟他一起去 服从他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandor, you will go with him. Obey him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:26.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把所有曾经接独过微缩影片的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every person who even comes into contact with that microfilm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:28.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,统统都干掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is to be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.69,0:19:45.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直升机准备起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by for helicopter takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.30,0:19:48.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人员离开飞行甲板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel, clear the flight deck platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把二千万元的转帐取消\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cancel transfer of $20 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.60,0:20:25.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知会马柯堆兹教授...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inform next of kin that a tragic accident...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:28.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和巴哈曼博士的亲属\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has resulted in the death of Professor Markovitz...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.71,0:20:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不幸遇难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Dr. Bechmann.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.11,0:20:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并已进行海葬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The funeral was at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.27,0:21:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿真主赐福给这个堂皇的住宅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May the peace of Allah descend upon this magnificent abode...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.27,0:21:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并容许我这个孤苦的旅客进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and allow a poor traveler to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿这个粗劣的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May the hospitality of these miserable quarters...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:43.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能够满足你那尊贵的需求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}be sufficient to your honored needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:52.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯.邦德 多年不见  很高兴再见到你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Bond, what a delightful surprise after all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.52,0:21:53.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 请坐 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sit down. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.16,0:22:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在纳闷 你离开剑桥后改究竟在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always wondered what you were gonna do when you went down from Cambridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.20,0:22:04.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来都知道你想要做什么 胡笙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never had any problems knowing what you were going to do, Hosein.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.54,0:22:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是只有石油而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't only have oil, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.87,0:22:12.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要什么?羊的眼睛?枣子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I offer you? Sheep's eyes? Dates?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.21,0:22:15.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是伏特加马丁尼? - 情报资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Vodka martini? - Information.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.35,0:22:17.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁要出售潜艇追踪系统?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is putting the submarine tracking system on the market?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.55,0:22:22.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在商业上这么有毅力 还真可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a pity it is you insist on being so businesslike.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.63,0:22:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终会跟你交手的那个人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The gentleman you will eventually be dealing with...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.03,0:22:35.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫马斯卡巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a certain Max Kalba.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.83,0:22:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 最终?  - 要接触卡巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Eventually?" - To reach Kalba...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.17,0:22:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得跟一个叫菲克治的人联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you must first make contact with a man called Fekkesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.07,0:22:44.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把他在开罗的地做给你吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aziz Fekkesh. I'll give you his apartment address in Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.41,0:22:47.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天已太晚去见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late to meet him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.41,0:22:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你晚上愿意留宿在这吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I persuade you to accept a bed for the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.88,0:22:57.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 不过…我觉得...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's kind of you, Hosein, but I really feel I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.39,0:23:08.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的不要在这里留宿吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you quite sure I can't persuade you to stay the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.33,0:23:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当一个人来到埃及时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When one is in Egypt...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.97,0:23:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很应该好好地挖掘当地的宝藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one should delve deeply into its treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.85,0:24:39.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是 对不起 大门是开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Oh, I'm sorry. The door was open.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.49,0:24:42.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在电话上跟菲克治先生约好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Fekkesh is expecting me. I phoned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.36,0:24:43.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫我带个讯息给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He asked me to give you a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.99,0:24:45.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他晚一点才有空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.80,0:24:47.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问他在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.86,0:24:51.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他吩咐我在你等待时 要好好的招待你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Fekkesh asked me to entertain you while you are waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.57,0:24:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.08,0:25:06.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲克治在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Fekkesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.32,0:25:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的疑心很重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are very suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.55,0:25:10.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我这样会活得更久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I find I live much longer that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.82,0:25:12.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.23,0:25:21.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你有任何需要的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's anything at all you would like...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.23,0:25:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已生吃过了中饭 可是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had lunch, but I seem to have missed dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.04,0:25:36.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我急欲跟他会面 但也不想他突然出现  打扰我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As urgent as my appointment is, I'd hate him to walk in and surprise us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.71,0:25:39.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no danger of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.08,0:25:43.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会这么快来到吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be some time then?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.32,0:25:46.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还有别的约会吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he meeting someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.53,0:25:51.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我不可以回答你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I cannot answer that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.80,0:25:54.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I think you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.48,0:27:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲克治在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Fekkesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.55,0:27:19.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全字塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pyramids.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.42,0:27:25.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对我真是有帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a helpful chap.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.10,0:27:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天晚上 你来到了全球…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have come tonight to the most fabulous...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.07,0:27:38.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最迷人和著名的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and celebrated place in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.20,0:27:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在吉萨高原上 永恒地耸立着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here on the Plateau of Giza stands forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.31,0:27:47.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类最伟大的成就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the mightiest of human achievements.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.81,0:27:53.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有曾踩踏过这片黄沙的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No traveler, emperor, merchant or poet...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.48,0:27:56.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,旅客、帝王、商人和诗人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has trodden on these sands...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.75,0:27:59.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对之无不肃然起敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and not gasped in awe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.09,0:28:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夜幕随之升起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The curtain of night is about to rise...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.70,0:28:09.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舞台上即将要上演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and disclose the stage on which...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.87,0:28:12.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个文明国度的戏剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the drama of a civilization took place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.57,0:28:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当中的东西自盘古初开已经存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those involved have been present since the dawn of history...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.28,0:28:23.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顽强地跟风沙对抗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pitched stubbornly against sand and wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.15,0:28:29.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沙漠的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the voice of the desert...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.69,0:28:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连续多个世纪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has crossed the centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.27,0:28:46.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失陪一会 我马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Major. I'll be back in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.11,0:29:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个黎明 我看着旭日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With each new dawn, I see the sun god rise...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.88,0:29:03.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在尼罗河岸东升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the far bank of the Nile.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.03,0:29:57.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是他那忠心的看守人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the faithful warden at the foot of his lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.91,0:30:01.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我既忠心 又有警觉性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So faithful, so vigilant...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.28,0:30:03.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟他非常靠近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so near him...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.91,0:30:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他向我显现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he gave me his face for my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.05,0:30:13.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是法老的同伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a pharaoh's companion...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.39,0:30:18.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是他 法老王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I am he, the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.03,0:31:00.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是四千五百年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the tomb of Cheops...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.94,0:31:06.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第四王朝的基奥普斯王的陵墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pharaoh of the Fourth Dynasty 4,500 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.81,0:31:10.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他建了这座全字塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here is the Great Pyramid which he built...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.71,0:31:14.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护自己 跟死神对抗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to defend himself against death.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.84,0:31:40.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在陵墓深处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here in the depths of his tomb...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.74,0:31:43.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皇帝的仆人正等待着被召唤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a servant of the king awaits the call...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.68,0:31:47.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以展开迈向永恒之旅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to set out upon his journey into eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.68,0:31:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死神在等待看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death lies waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.33,0:31:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(马斯卡巴 穆杰巴俱乐部 晚上九时四十分)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.11,0:32:15.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲克治在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Fekkesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.61,0:32:17.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟法老在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the pharaohs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.85,0:32:20.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你杀了他 - 不 我发现他时 他已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You killed him. - No, he was dead when I found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.71,0:32:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你喜欢这场秀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope you enjoyed the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.18,0:32:49.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.22,0:33:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是喜出望外 欢迎来到穆杰巴俱乐部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What an unexpected pleasure. Welcome to the Mujaba Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.99,0:33:34.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要喝一杯吗? 阿玛索娃少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buy you a drink, Major Amasova?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.72,0:33:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是我该称呼你做3X?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or may I call you XXX?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.79,0:33:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.66,0:33:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让人留下深刻印象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made quite an impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.86,0:33:44.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我替我的手下道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry about Ivan and Boris.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.43,0:33:46.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们做得过火了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They exceeded their orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.30,0:33:48.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好员工难求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good staff is hard to find these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.01,0:33:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.77,0:33:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请给这位小姐一杯巴卡第加冰块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lady will have a Bacardi on the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.54,0:33:58.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位先生要伏特加马丁尼 要摇而不要搅的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the gentleman, vodka martini, shaken not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.28,0:34:01.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Touche.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.15,0:34:03.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯.邦德海军中校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.22,0:34:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被选中加入了英国情报组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recruited to the British Secret Service from the Royal Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.79,0:34:10.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以合法杀人 杀人无数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Licensed to kill, and has done so on numerous occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.36,0:34:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拥有无数女朋友 曾结过一次婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many lady friends, but married only once.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.20,0:34:16.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 妻子被杀... - 好了 我知道你很了解我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wife killed... - All right, you've made your point.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.37,0:34:19.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很敏感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.94,0:34:21.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对某些事确很敏感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About certain things, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.71,0:34:24.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请恕我失陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.64,0:34:26.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很可惜 我已经有约会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tragically, I have a previous engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.98,0:34:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happily enough, so do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.28,0:34:32.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 告辞了 邦德先生 - 应该说再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good-bye, Mr. Bond. - Let's say au revoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.48,0:34:36.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个很奇怪的预感 我们会再见的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have the oddest feeling we'll be meeting again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.06,0:34:46.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找卡巴先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for Mr. Kalba.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.56,0:34:49.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡巴先生是这个俱乐部的老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Max Kalba is the owner of the club, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.37,0:34:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.62,0:35:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡巴先生? 我叫詹姆斯 邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Kalba, my name is James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.73,0:35:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.70,0:35:21.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟菲克治先生有约会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had an appointment with Mr. Fekkesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.76,0:35:25.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那又如何? - 他不能来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well? - He won't be joining you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.51,0:35:38.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有一些我想买的东西 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have something I'm interested in buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.55,0:35:40.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对那东西也有兴趣竞投\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a moment. I would like to bid for it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.45,0:35:46.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你忘了拿饮品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You forgot your drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.66,0:35:49.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.26,0:35:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你有对手了 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems you have competition, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.46,0:35:55.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我看来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From where I sit...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.60,0:36:00.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也看得出来她的身段一流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fancy you will find the lady's figure hard to match.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.80,0:36:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,号争者可以看看那件东西吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might the contestants be permitted to view the article for sale?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.98,0:36:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁要先喊价?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now, who will start the bidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.32,0:36:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡巴先生 有电话找你 是紧急电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Kalba, sir, the telephone. An urgent call.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.76,0:36:25.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.67,0:36:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.61,0:36:46.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是卡巴 请问是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Kalba. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.75,0:37:24.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要再来一杯吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.26,0:37:56.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(暂停使用)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.49,0:38:40.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能再用这种方式见面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've really got to stop meeting like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.27,0:38:45.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡巴去接电话了 他怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kalba was called to the phone. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.87,0:38:50.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他被打断…永久地打断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was cut off, permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.21,0:38:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那卷微缩影片呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the microfilm?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.04,0:38:55.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以搜身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.55,0:38:58.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是给他拿走了 否则你不会在这里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must have it, or you wouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.28,0:38:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道他的来历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.78,0:39:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他是职业杀手 - 外号大钢牙?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's a professional killer. - Called Jaws?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.95,0:39:06.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make no mistake, Mr. Bond...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.32,0:39:08.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那卷微缩影片...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want that microfilm...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.66,0:39:10.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是要定的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm going to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.83,0:39:12.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非是我先得手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless I get it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.99,0:42:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.90,0:42:43.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.18,0:42:52.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,微缩影片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the microfilm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.29,0:43:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃及的建筑商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Egyptian builders.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.56,0:44:10.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 你迟了一步了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. You're just too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.30,0:44:13.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.40,0:44:17.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The key!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.14,0:44:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试用大钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try the big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.22,0:44:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它可以弹别的音调吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you play any other tune?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.16,0:44:42.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们试倒裆 就是向后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's try reverse. That's backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.31,0:45:01.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我来开车好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like me to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.29,0:45:10.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人驾驶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Women drivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.79,0:45:12.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 你看着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.06,0:45:19.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是摇而不是搅的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaken, but not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.63,0:45:54.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是铆工 替这头大猩猩镶的牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That gorilla must have his teeth fixed by a riveter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.33,0:45:57.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你刚才弃我而去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, thanks for deserting me back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.50,0:45:59.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人都得为自己打算 记得吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every woman for herself. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.40,0:46:04.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你依然救了我一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still, you did save my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.01,0:46:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣人都会犯错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all make mistakes, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.45,0:46:43.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气缸盖的密封垫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cylinder head gasket.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.79,0:47:33.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.30,0:47:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他觉得我们穿得过分隆重了  不过他会送我们去开罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thinks we're overdressed, but he'll take us to Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.27,0:47:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.03,0:48:40.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,越来越冷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.76,0:48:43.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要怎么做才能使你暖一点?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anything I can do to warm you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.63,0:48:46.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不必担心我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.90,0:48:49.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在西伯利亚曾经上过求生课程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went on a survival course in Siberia.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.40,0:48:54.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你们很多同胞也修过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I believe a great number of your countrymen do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.41,0:48:55.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们教你什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did they teach you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.94,0:49:00.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拥有积极的斗志是非常重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That it's very important to have a positive mental attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.58,0:49:03.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有更实际一点的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing more practical than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.15,0:49:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,食物也是非常重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Food is also very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.09,0:49:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.59,0:49:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在有需要的时候互相取暖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When necessary, shared bodily warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.16,0:49:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the part I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.37,0:49:28.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在西伯利亚真的是这么做的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this really what they do in Siberia?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.54,0:49:32.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 不过做法不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but not how they do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.89,0:49:47.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是想占我的便宜 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not trying to take advantage of me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.43,0:49:51.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没这样想过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thought never crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.17,0:50:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就当事情越来越有意思的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just when it was getting interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.31,0:50:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女孩在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.05,0:51:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 早安 钱班儿 - 早安 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Morning, Moneypenny. - Good morning, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.95,0:51:54.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在里面吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he in?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.16,0:51:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是个很热闹派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must have been quite a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.53,0:51:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闷死人 钱班儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.16,0:52:00.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 我睡着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dropped off.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.55,0:52:21.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 我们正在等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, James. We've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.72,0:52:23.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.22,0:52:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计划有变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been a change in plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.69,0:52:31.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也许已经认出了他是国安会的戈高尔将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You probably recognize my opposite number in the KGB, General Gogol.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.23,0:52:35.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你跟阿玛索娃少校很熟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe you're familiar with Major Amasova.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.23,0:52:37.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只知道她抽哪个品牌的香烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough to know which brand of cigarette she smokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.47,0:52:39.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对方政府都同意投资资源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our respective governments...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.17,0:52:43.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以协助我们找出潜艇的下落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}agreed to pool their resources to find out what happened to our submarines.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.24,0:52:46.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们踏入了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have entered a new era...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.31,0:52:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,英苏合作的新纪元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Anglo-Soviet cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.48,0:52:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了显示饿国的诚意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a sign of Russian good faith...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.95,0:52:53.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我准备交出由3X找到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm prepared to make available to you the microfilm...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.98,0:52:56.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,微缩影片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}recovered by Agent XXX.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.52,0:52:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以说是不费吹灰之力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With considerable ease, I might add.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.62,0:53:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别费心了 这东西一点用都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bother. It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.79,0:53:05.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在船上检查过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I examined it on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.03,0:53:09.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以保证它是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assure you it is quite genuine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.33,0:53:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是最重要的技术资料已经被拿走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except that the vital technical information has been taken out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.53,0:53:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西只是用来吊我们的胃口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was only intended to whet our appetites.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.88,0:53:23.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许Q会有所发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe Q can make something out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.33,0:53:44.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要那在在茶会前准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want that ready for Akmid's tea party.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.27,0:53:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you, Alexis.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.93,0:53:50.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 你先走 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- After you, Miles. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.96,0:54:11.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可使你掉眼泪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could bring tears to your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.47,0:54:22.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家准备好了没有?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody ready? Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.17,0:54:27.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们确定这些图像是在意大利起草的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're pretty certain that this drawing was drafted in Italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.64,0:54:30.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纸张是威尼斯制的八开纸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The size corresponds with a Venetian octavo...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.61,0:54:33.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,字样是意大利文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the typeface is an Italian one.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.11,0:54:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,截线上有一条轻微的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, note the slight upward stress on the transversals.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.48,0:54:39.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么标记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that mark there?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.95,0:54:43.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该放在...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably a show-through of something...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.29,0:54:45.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草图下面的纸张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the drawing was resting on when it was photographed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.46,0:54:47.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是匆忙拍下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must have been done in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.49,0:54:50.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 可以把它放大吗? - 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you enlarge it? - Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.47,0:54:53.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(小礼拜堂)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.47,0:54:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- "小礼拜堂"是什么意思? - 即是礼拜堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Oratory?" What is that? - It's another word for chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.67,0:55:00.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来像是主教的冠冕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks a bit like a bishop's mitre.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.17,0:55:03.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是一条鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.04,0:55:06.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是斯特龙伯格航运的标志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the symbol of the Stromberg Shipping Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.91,0:55:09.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界超级富豪之一的卡尔斯特龙伯格?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karl Stromberg? He's one of the richest men in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.88,0:55:13.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是西方主要的资本主义剥削者之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the principle capitalist exploiters of the West, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.39,0:55:15.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是"礼拜堂"而是"实验室"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's not "oratory," it's laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.55,0:55:18.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯特龙伯格拥有海洋研究实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stromberg has a marine research laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.36,0:55:19.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是在科西嘉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On Corsica, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.96,0:55:23.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.26,0:55:26.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实那是在萨丁尼亚岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, it is in Sardinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.00,0:55:32.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.91,0:55:35.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信这两位能干的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm certain that two such perceptive talents...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.84,0:55:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会喜欢一起到萨丁尼亚岛工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will enjoy working together in Sardinia...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.11,0:55:43.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实践英苏合作的梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that it will help to make Anglo-Soviet cooperation a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.60,0:56:02.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.10,0:56:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚餐非常美味 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a delicious meal. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.84,0:56:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道原来你的胃口是这么大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't realize you had such a healthy appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.28,0:56:11.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.94,0:56:15.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是搭火车的关系吧 我很喜欢搭火车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must be traveling by train. I always enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.18,0:56:17.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得有一次...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember when...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.82,0:56:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你记起了什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.49,0:56:22.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我几乎要谈到一趟任务了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was going to talk about a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.62,0:56:25.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很可笑吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silly, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.46,0:56:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是同行 却不能交谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't talk, and yet we're in the same business.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.66,0:56:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 而且还处于敌对的阵营 - 现在我们并不是敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But with rival companies. - We're not rivals at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.60,0:56:38.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有兴趣在睡前跟我喝一杯吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then how about a nightcap, on the company?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.94,0:56:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My company.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.44,0:56:44.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我有预感明天将会很忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very sorry. I have an idea tomorrow is going to be a busy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.64,0:56:48.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我必须要睡觉 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I must sleep. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.25,0:56:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 好好睡 - 你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, then, sleep well. - And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.32,0:56:54.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.46,0:59:45.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.72,0:59:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他走进来要吃东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just dropped in for a quick bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.90,0:59:52.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你受伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.23,0:59:54.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待会再处理它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.90,0:59:57.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我先照顾你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.57,1:00:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在求生训练上如何教你的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was it they taught you on that survival course?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.24,1:00:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要有积极的斗志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A positive mental attitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.08,1:00:08.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,互相取暖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And shared bodily warmth.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.92,1:00:12.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没说过要怎么避风吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing about keeping out of drafts?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.60,1:00:17.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你仍然喜欢搭火车吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still enjoy traveling by train?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.11,1:00:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你救了我一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.41,1:00:25.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.75,1:00:28.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.79,1:00:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不先躺下让我看看?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you lie down and let me look at it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.75,1:01:01.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绷带要怎么用?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can we use for a bandage?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.25,1:01:04.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.06,1:01:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.75,1:02:11.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 早安 少校 - 早安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning, Major Boothroyd. - Good morning, Major.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.92,1:02:14.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看Q带了什么给我们 很不错吧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what Q has brought for us. Isn't it nice?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.43,1:02:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你留踪听好 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Now pay attention, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.43,1:02:25.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你小踪使用它 它有特殊装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take great care of this equipment. There are some special accessories...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.67,1:02:29.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我有试过让你失望吗了 - 经常都会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have I ever let you down? - Frequently.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.57,1:03:04.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们预订了房间的 我们姓斯特林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a reservation for me. The name is Sterling.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.01,1:03:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 斯特林伉俪 在开罗预订的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Mr. And Mrs. Sterling. Booked from Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.78,1:03:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.28,1:03:15.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们预留了A5套房 里面包括客厅 和两间卧房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have Suite A-5 for you; a sitting room and two bedrooms.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.05,1:03:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钱班儿真是过分有效率了 我有留言吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moneypenny being over-efficient. Do you have any messages for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.93,1:03:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.43,1:03:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 他愿意正式接见我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent. We have been granted an audience.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.46,1:04:05.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 斯特林先生 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Sterling? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.13,1:04:09.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫娜欧蜜 斯特龙伯格先生派我来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Naomi. Mr. Stromberg sent me to collect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.14,1:04:11.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗? 她是内子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you do? This is my wife...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.54,1:04:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是我的助年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who also happens to be my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.87,1:04:16.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是来度假的吗 - 只要是有海洋的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are on holiday here? - Where there's an ocean...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.81,1:04:19.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海洋生物学家就无法休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a marine biologist is never on holiday.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.51,1:04:21.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以先请你喝一杯吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we offer you a drink before we go?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.82,1:04:24.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 谢了 斯特龙伯格先生是非常忙碌的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thank you. Mr. Stromberg's a very busy man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.82,1:04:26.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的时间很宝贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His time is precious.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.82,1:04:31.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真漂亮的造物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a handsome craft.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.56,1:04:33.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,线条一流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such lovely lines.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.49,1:05:33.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.99,1:05:36.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是令人钦佩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.63,1:05:44.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟斯特龙伯格先生见面时...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder if you'd mind showing my wife around...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.63,1:05:47.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你可以带我妻子游览一下吗? - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- while I'm with Mr. Stromberg. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.10,1:05:48.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 还边走 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This way. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.93,1:05:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别替娜欧蜜添麻烦 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be a bother to Naomi, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.67,1:05:53.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我为上回来 - 还有一件事...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll be back soon. - By the way...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.01,1:05:57.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生不太喜欢握年的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stromberg prefers not to shake hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.11,1:06:00.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 请按第三个按钮 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's the third button. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.04,1:06:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当地球还有恕成的地方…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do we seek to conquer space...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.05,1:06:39.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有待发掘时 为何还要征服太空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when seven-tenths of our universe remains to be explored?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.65,1:06:41.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海底世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world beneath the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.65,1:06:45.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看来已经准备就绪 要修正还个错处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem to be well-equipped to repair that oversight.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.59,1:06:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫劳勃斯特林 非常感谢你接见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Robert Sterling. It's very kind of you to receive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.47,1:06:57.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很乐意跟志同道合的人见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's always a pleasure to welcome someone with a mutual interest.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.77,1:07:02.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还里有数目繁多的珍贵品种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An extraordinary number of rare species.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.28,1:07:09.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当然可以分辨那是什么吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You recognize that variety, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.82,1:07:16.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.73,1:07:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有翅飞鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other fish avoid it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.93,1:07:26.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他鱼类对他都敬而远之 背上的刺充满毒液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those dorsal spines are laden with venom.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.23,1:07:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很漂亮 却是从以致命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Handsome, but deadly.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.80,1:07:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然是这方面的专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you know your subject.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.47,1:07:36.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功在于尝试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One tries.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.48,1:07:39.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的家非常华丽壮观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a remarkable establishment here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.65,1:07:42.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢遁世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm somewhat of a recluse.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.82,1:07:46.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望可以用我喜欢的形式生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish to conduct my life on my own terms...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.59,1:07:51.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住在我认同的环境里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and in surroundings with which I can identify.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.59,1:07:54.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是有钱人的特权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a privilege of wealth.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.43,1:07:57.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不怀念外面的世界吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you miss the outside world?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.76,1:08:02.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说 还里就是全世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For me, this is all the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.10,1:08:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有美好的一面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's beauty...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.44,1:08:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有丑陋的一面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's ugliness...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.78,1:08:12.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there is death.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.28,1:08:17.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定会对这个很感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you will find this interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.49,1:08:21.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海底城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An underwater city.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.29,1:08:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很迷人 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fascinating, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.46,1:08:26.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是人类未来的唯一希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only hope for the future of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.79,1:08:28.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都有梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all have our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.29,1:08:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是梦想 斯特林先生很快就会成真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No dream, Mr. Sterling. Soon a reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.90,1:08:38.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请恕我失陪 我还要处理事务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid you must excuse me. I have business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.97,1:08:41.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见 斯特林先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.47,1:08:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如我们不会再见 我祝福你的研究顺利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't meet again, I wish you luck with your research.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.08,1:08:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 今天的惊鸿一瞥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. The brief glimpse you've afforded me today...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.91,1:08:52.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会激励我更用踪研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will only encourage me to redouble my efforts.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.58,1:08:54.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.94,1:09:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 真有趣 - 你在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How interesting. - There you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.77,1:09:16.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得看看这个模型 真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darling, you should look at this model. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.44,1:09:19.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是本公司船队的最新成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Liparus...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.11,1:09:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利帕鲁斯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the latest addition to the Stromberg fleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.51,1:09:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九个月前才下水的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launched nine months ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.45,1:09:26.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它重逾一百万吨 是世上最大的油轮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At over a million tons, it's the largest tanker in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.49,1:09:30.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 还是比不上马克斯号 - 真的吗了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- After the Karl Marx, of course. - Really, darling?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.46,1:09:33.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的见识真是广博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's amazing the items of information you store away.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.80,1:09:42.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就是火车上的人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were they the two on the train?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.24,1:09:46.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯.邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Bond...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.91,1:09:50.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女的是俄国特工阿玛索娃少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the woman is Major Amasova, a Russian agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.41,1:09:54.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们走到岸边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let them get ashore...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.92,1:09:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后把他们干掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.60,1:10:15.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么神秘亏亏的? 我们要到哪去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're being very secretive. Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.60,1:10:18.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想再看一下那个实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want another look at that Stromberg laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.44,1:10:21.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以从那儿操纵追踪系统吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think you could operate the tracking system from there?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.54,1:10:23.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.11,1:10:25.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只知道那两艘核潜艇失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All we know for sure is that two nuclear submarines are missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.13,1:10:48.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得那艘油轮的模型怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you think of that tanker model?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.30,1:10:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,船头的设计有点古怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was something strange about the design of her bows.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.40,1:10:52.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已要求M去调查一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've asked M to check her out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.78,1:11:03.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 詹姆斯 那辆机车... - 已经跟踪了我们一英里多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- James, that motorcycle... - Has been following us for a mile.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.07,1:12:00.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然它有羽饰 始终不能飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All those feathers and he still can't fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.75,1:12:10.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 你不用说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I know. Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.19,1:13:27.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你曾否感觉过有人不喜欢你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever get the feeling somebody doesn't like you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.54,1:14:51.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会游泳吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you swim?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.81,1:15:23.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是该向不速之客道别的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time we said good-bye to an uninvited guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.60,1:15:52.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于没有人骚扰我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alone at last.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.64,1:16:32.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就是要看还个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what we've come to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.38,1:17:44.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扶稳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.56,1:17:53.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.90,1:18:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会知道的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.67,1:18:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两年前 我偷了这辆车子的蓝图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stole the blueprints of this car two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.58,1:18:48.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会没事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think we can make it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.92,1:20:01.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.92,1:20:06.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我有个留言要给你 - 你刚刚已经传送过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have a message for you. - I think you just delivered it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.42,1:20:09.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.37,1:20:26.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉打扰你了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to interrupt you...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.94,1:20:29.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要M替我调查…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I asked M for a list of all the ports...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.11,1:20:31.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那艘油轮停泊的港口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Stromberg tanker had called at.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.45,1:20:33.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答案如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the answer?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.12,1:20:35.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她自建成以来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the nine months since she was fitted out...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.12,1:20:38.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从没停泊的记绿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is no record of her having put into port anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.46,1:20:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若是真的话 那就很奇怪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's very odd, if it's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.96,1:20:46.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这方面 我们不会弄错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't make mistakes of that sort.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.73,1:20:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的口气很像俄国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sound just like a Russian.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.73,1:20:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该仔细检查那艘油轮 你觉得呢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we should take a closer look at that tanker, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.74,1:20:57.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.24,1:21:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该联络戈高尔吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall I contact Gogol?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.08,1:21:02.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没这个需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no need.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.41,1:21:07.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- M已经通知了他 - 很漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- M has already offered to fix it. - Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.32,1:21:10.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在奥地利伯加顿买的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Austrian. I bought it in Berngarten.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.09,1:21:17.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 当时我在滑雪 - 什么时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was doing some skiing. - When was this?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.69,1:21:19.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概三个星期 干吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About three weeks ago. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.27,1:21:34.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认得他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you recognize him?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.48,1:21:37.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.78,1:21:42.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man I loved.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.28,1:21:46.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三周前他在伯加顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was in Berngarten three weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.09,1:21:49.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是否杀了他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.23,1:21:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当有人要在你身后...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When someone's behind you on skis at 40 miles an hour...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.57,1:22:01.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,边杀你的时候...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trying to put a bullet in your back...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.24,1:22:03.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会有时间去记住他的客貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you don't always have time to remember a face.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.24,1:22:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们这行 总会有人被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In our business, people get killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.75,1:22:13.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都知道 他也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We both know that. So did he.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.58,1:22:17.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是他死 便是我亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was either him or me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.45,1:22:21.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题的答案是: 是的 我杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer to the question is yes. I did kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.93,1:22:27.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 当任务完成之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, when this mission is over...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.73,1:22:29.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.56,1:22:57.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.40,1:23:04.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 卡特司令官?  - 我就是 欢迎你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Commander Carter? - That's right. Welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.73,1:23:09.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少校 请坐 你要喝点什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major. Have a seat. Can I get you something?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.57,1:23:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 谢了 不知道少校要不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for me, thank you. I don't know about the major.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.08,1:23:19.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我没想到你是女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I hadn't expected you to be a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.78,1:23:24.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是俄军的阿玛索娃少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aboard this vessel, Commander, I am Major Amasova of the Russian Army.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.29,1:23:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 对 - 谢谢你出手相助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, sure. - It's good of you to help us out.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.66,1:23:29.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经为你们准备了两个客舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a couple cabins at your disposal.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.73,1:23:31.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.26,1:23:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少校 欢迎你使用我的浴室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major, you're most welcome to use the shower in my quarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.53,1:23:37.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不用特别优待我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do not have to show me any special favors, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.70,1:23:40.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只觉得这样做比较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the same, I think it might be better if I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.11,1:23:50.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是太平洋的潜艇传过来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From Com Sub Atlantic, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.58,1:23:52.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.52,1:24:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter, sailor?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.69,1:24:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没见过少校洗澡吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never see a major taking a shower before?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.26,1:24:20.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(尼帕鲁斯号)
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.18,1:24:28.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备再次观察目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by for second observation on target.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.12,1:24:29.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,启动潜望镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up scope.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.19,1:24:35.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.06,1:24:44.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目标方向及距离已记下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target bearing. Mark. Range. Mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.27,1:24:47.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下潜望镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down scope.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.40,1:24:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 一个师团 - 距离六千二百码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One division in high power. - Range 6,200 yards, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.14,1:24:53.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,船头的角度五十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angle on the bow, port 50.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.14,1:24:55.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,控制室、鱼雷室 登艇部队已准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Control, Torpedo Room. Boarding party ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.05,1:25:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,船长 最佳的方法是120时速三海里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, sir, our best solution for the target is 120. Speed three knots.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.05,1:25:09.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甲板 向北面转 驾驶舱 加速至11海里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officer of the deck, come right north. Maneuvering, make turns for 11 knots.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.52,1:25:11.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甲板船员收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officer of the deck, aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.09,1:25:15.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪颗子弹有我的名字?  第一颗还是最后一颗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which bullet has my name on it? The first or the last?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.43,1:25:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没失败试过任何任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have never failed on a mission, Commander. Any mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.37,1:25:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In that case, Major...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.87,1:25:25.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之间必然有一方会很失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one of us is bound to end up gravely disappointed...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.01,1:25:27.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because neither of the...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.48,1:25:33.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,指挥部 电频率中断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Control, Maneuvering. We're losing electrical frequency.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.48,1:25:37.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,声纳室叫指挥部 电力中斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Control, Sonar. Total power supplies failure on all sets.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.29,1:25:40.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浮出水面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surface! Blow forward! Blow aft!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.94,1:25:59.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备潜望镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up scope. Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.88,1:26:07.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.05,1:26:11.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在我们后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's right behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.46,1:26:18.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.39,1:27:25.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二号船坞准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by on number two dock.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.53,1:27:30.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼帕鲁斯号船员们 各就各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liparus crew, take up positions.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.23,1:27:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,船坞船员到操作室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dock Officer to Operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.97,1:27:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,调动组组员进入船坞范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mobilization crew entering dock area.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.14,1:27:45.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二号船坞呼叫操作室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number two dock to Operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.08,1:27:47.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有二十五米 我重复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-five meters to run. I say again.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.89,1:27:57.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,操作室呼叫二号船坞 船只已进入船坞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Operation Room to number two dock. Docking now complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.42,1:28:00.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,登陆船员各就各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disembarkation crew moving into position.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.94,1:28:15.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,S射线程序完成 磁场关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S Ray program completed. Magnetic field shut down.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.94,1:28:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,系统正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All systems normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.18,1:28:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扬声器已准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Limpet speaker in position, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.71,1:28:24.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,司令官 你有两分钟的时间…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander, you have precisely two minutes...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.65,1:28:27.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打开舱口 弃船投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to open your hatches and surrender your ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.95,1:28:33.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则你们会被…氰毒气处决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The alternative is extermination by cyanide gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.63,1:28:36.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.00,1:28:38.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本没有选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no alternative.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.64,1:28:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们听好船长的说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now hear this. Your Captain speaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.80,1:28:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把所有舱口打开 肃静的离开船只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open all hatches and proceed quietly onto the casing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.62,1:29:01.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶快 我没什么耐性的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, Commander. I'm not renown for my patience.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.39,1:29:07.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,列成两队 行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, two ranks. Move it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.86,1:29:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧跟着我 我们会尽量掩护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay close to me. We'll try and hide you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.03,1:29:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间有限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our time is limited, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.07,1:29:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 马上开始行动 - 遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Commence operations forthwith. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.27,1:29:24.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人员听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention all personnel.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.81,1:29:27.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯特龙伯格第一及第二队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stromberg crews One and Two...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.41,1:29:29.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要登上你们的潜艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}embark your submarines.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.43,1:29:46.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这些美国人跟其他人关在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put the Americans in with the others, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.80,1:29:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把俘虏带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remove the prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.31,1:29:59.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别抬头望 有人在偷拍我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look up. You're on Candid Camera.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.75,1:30:04.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经装上核导弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Complete nuclear missile loading.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.12,1:30:41.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雷达室呼叫操作室 方圆二万五千米以内没有联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Operations, Radar. No contacts within 25,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.42,1:30:43.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那两名俘虏带进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring those two prisoners here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.21,1:31:09.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.85,1:31:11.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,声纳室叫操作室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Operations Room, Sonar.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.68,1:31:13.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准联络和发送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No contacts, no transmissions.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.65,1:31:15.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停止稳定装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cease stable hold.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.39,1:31:21.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们真是锲而不舍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have certainly been persistent.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.99,1:31:26.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我可以满足你们的好奇心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well. Now your curiosity can be satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.50,1:31:28.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两组的人员已经登船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both crews aboard, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.27,1:31:29.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,核导弹已经装置完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missile onload completed.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.00,1:31:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经知道了自己的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have already been given their targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.81,1:31:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们在十二点整低达开火的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At 12:00 noon, they will have reached firing positions.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.48,1:31:40.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纽约和莫斯科…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Within minutes, New York and Moscow...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.95,1:31:42.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快就会消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will cease to exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.95,1:31:45.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着世界将会瓦解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Global destruction will follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.95,1:31:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的纪元即将开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The new era will begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.62,1:31:52.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一号及二号潜艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Submarines One and Two...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.56,1:31:55.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始出发程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}commence departure drill.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.69,1:31:58.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我知道你是来真的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you've made your point.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.76,1:32:00.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要多少?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.37,1:32:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多少?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"How much?"
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.87,1:32:04.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟你指的是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever do you mean, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.97,1:32:08.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不发射核导弹的代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The price for not firing those nuclear missiles.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.51,1:32:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你受骗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're deluded, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.24,1:32:14.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并不是要敲诈勒索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not interested in extortion.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.05,1:32:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是要改变历史的面貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I intend to change the face of history.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.65,1:32:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你要毁灭世界?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By destroying the world?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.49,1:32:22.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该说是创造世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By creating a world.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.19,1:32:25.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个在海洋里的美丽新世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new and beautiful world beneath the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.36,1:32:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天的人类文明既腐败又堕落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, civilization as we know it is corrupt and decadent.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.83,1:32:32.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终有一天会自取灭亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inevitably, it will destroy itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.56,1:32:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是加速这件事的发生而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm merely accelerating the process.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.57,1:32:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还并不能为大屠杀辩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That does not justify mass murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.61,1:32:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对与错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For that, Major...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.77,1:32:44.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会留待后世去评价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will accept the judgment of posterity.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.94,1:32:48.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜艇可以出发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Submarines ready for departure, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.68,1:32:52.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打开船头的门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open bow doors, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.42,1:32:59.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯特龙伯格一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stromberg One...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.42,1:33:02.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are clear to proceed to sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.03,1:33:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯特龙伯格二号 你也可以出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stromberg Two, you are also clear to proceed to sea. Forward stern.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.01,1:33:21.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好看清楚用来毁灭世界的工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Observe, Mr. Bond, the instruments of Armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.58,1:33:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这个人跟其他俘虏一并关起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put this man with the rest of the prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.98,1:34:01.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还位小姐会跟我一起到亚特兰蒂斯去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lady will be traveling to Atlantis with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.70,1:34:12.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别了 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Farewell, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.70,1:34:14.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得说 这个词语…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That word has, I must admit...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.00,1:34:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次意味着永恒的离别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a welcome ring of permanency about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.01,1:34:21.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见 安雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Au revoir, Anya.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.88,1:34:24.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把她带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring her.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.82,1:35:09.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that man!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.03,1:35:19.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.71,1:35:36.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫他过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call him over.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.50,1:35:55.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 船长在哪? - 我就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's your captain? - Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.30,1:35:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找其他人 然后到军械库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release the other crews, then make for the armory.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.17,1:35:58.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来 赶快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me, men. At the double.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.98,1:36:08.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.92,1:36:17.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把操作室密封起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seal the operations room!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.37,1:36:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到那里准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You! Stand by over there!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.81,1:36:42.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help yourself to firearms!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.32,1:36:49.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿武器 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab a weapon. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.94,1:38:48.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已占领了船坞范围 但你们的船长已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've taken both sides of the lower dock area, but your captain's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.44,1:38:50.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是无法走近控制室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're still no closer to that control room.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.08,1:38:54.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave it to me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.62,1:39:00.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德鲁 詹姆斯 马歇尔 帕维斯跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andrews, James, Marchal, Purvis. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.75,1:39:33.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些铜板一定有几寸厚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That armored plating must be inches thick.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.39,1:39:35.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们无法把它射穿的 - 到军械库去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'll never get through it. - Let's get to the armory.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.69,1:39:37.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要到那里找什么 - 核导弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you reckon to find there? - A nuclear missile.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.92,1:39:40.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A nuc... Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.64,1:39:55.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这需要很长时间的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could take hours, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.81,1:39:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有约会吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a date?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.88,1:39:59.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.88,1:40:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you are beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.98,1:40:09.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若你觉得很辛苦 很对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry if you feel less than comfortable...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.39,1:40:13.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你有暴力倾向 我得把它控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you have a tendency to violence that must be controlled.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.50,1:40:20.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么了? - 我得报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? - I have to report, sir...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.00,1:40:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些犯人逃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a breakout by some of the prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.47,1:40:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是令人遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is unfortunate, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.50,1:40:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 情况已经受到控制了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, sir, we now have the situation under control.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.67,1:40:31.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们无法把控制室攻破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The operations room is quite impregnable.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.88,1:40:37.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你们不要再发生不幸的事故\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we must hope, Captain, that you will suffer no further mishap.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.06,1:40:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把雷管取出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I need out of here is the detonator.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.05,1:41:11.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的知道自己在干吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, are you sure you know what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.98,1:41:14.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凡事总有第一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There has to be a first time for everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.93,1:41:23.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blast.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.76,1:41:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.77,1:41:29.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能碰到脉动导体电路的任何一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mustn't touch any part of the impulse conductor circuit.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.67,1:41:33.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脉动导体电路就储藏在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ring houses the impulse conductor circuit, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.31,1:41:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是有磁性的 雷管万万不能碰到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's magnetic. I mustn't touch it with any part of the detonator.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.14,1:41:41.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 若碰到了会怎么样? - 它会爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happens if you do? - It'll go off.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.12,1:42:23.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要六号雷管 - 知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get me a number six detonator. - Aye, aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.19,1:42:30.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 六号 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Number six, sir. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.33,1:42:32.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是否准备了二十秒的导火线吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you fix that 20-second fuse?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.43,1:42:33.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.20,1:42:38.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塑胶炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plastic explosive.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.45,1:42:54.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切顺利吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everything proceeding according to plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.49,1:42:57.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 顺利 - 好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir. - Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.04,1:44:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 长官? - 怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir? - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.78,1:44:28.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,画面消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The monitors faded.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.80,1:44:52.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改变电路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Change the circuit.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.04,1:45:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cease fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.51,1:45:29.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too late, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.94,1:45:32.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜艇已经到达指定位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our submarines are already on station.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.04,1:45:36.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,导弹将会于四分钟之后发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In four minutes, the missiles will be launched.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.62,1:45:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会操作电报装置吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you work the printout transmission unit?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.82,1:45:45.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会 但是我们只剩下三分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, but we've only got three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.92,1:45:50.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我们找出潜艇的位置 就可以把程序改编\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we can work out the position of those submarines, maybe we can reprogram them.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.10,1:45:52.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 干什么? - 让他们自相残杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To do what? - To destroy each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.38,1:46:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(位置及移动方向)
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.10,1:46:32.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯! 那圆球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James! The globe!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.54,1:46:43.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把一号潜艇的位置列为二号潜艇的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pass the position of the first submarine to the second as their target.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.61,1:46:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 反之亦然 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And vice versa? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.00,1:47:14.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,导弹控制室 我是船长 目标有变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missile Control, this is the Captain. We have a change of target.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.84,1:47:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的坐标是034285219\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New coordinates are 034285219.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.36,1:47:39.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,导弹控制室 我是船长 目标有变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missile Control, Captain. We have a new target.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.68,1:49:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家回到潜艇里去 传话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody back on board the submarine! Pass it on!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.95,1:49:04.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.16,1:49:18.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,清除航线上的障碍 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foster, get those lines cleared! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.43,1:49:19.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家让路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leaver, throw those guys a line!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.17,1:49:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把前后的防护板清除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get those block fenders cleared! Fore and aft!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.97,1:49:26.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把潜艇调整至下潜的状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the submarine at diving stations!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.82,1:49:38.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驾驶舱呼叫指挥部 反应堆只剩下一半的动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Control, Maneuvering. Reactor at half-power state.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.52,1:49:39.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以接受电报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready to check telegraphs.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.02,1:49:43.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人员马上就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel, take up positions fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.19,1:49:45.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 叫劳勃操作回转仪 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get Roberts in the gyro unit. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.36,1:49:46.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.30,1:49:56.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备恢复正常灯光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by to revert to normal lighting.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.47,1:49:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶快把舱门关上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, sailor. Get that hatch shut quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.31,1:50:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 指挥部呼叫鱼雷室 - 鱼雷室收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Torpedo Room, Control. - Torpedo Room.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.98,1:50:06.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把46号鱼雷装上一号管道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Load tube one with mark 46 torpedo.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.69,1:50:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把一号管道的外层出口打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open outer door on tube one.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.33,1:50:21.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回转仪角度为零度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Select zero gyro angle.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.06,1:50:24.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外层出口已经打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outer door on tube one open.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.00,1:50:26.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞄准目标 发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Match bearings and shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.57,1:50:28.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备 - 发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Set. - Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.57,1:50:33.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鱼雷已经发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Torpedo running.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.73,1:50:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在船体中部装舵 在前头三分二的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rudder amidships. Ahead two-thirds.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.24,1:51:06.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向左移7度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left seven degrees rudder.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.10,1:52:42.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为有多远?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far would you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.84,1:52:48.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 大概是一万码 - 指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- About 10,000 yards, sir. - Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.45,1:52:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.62,1:53:04.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我收到国防部的讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just got this signal from the Pentagon.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.96,1:53:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安全理事会发出指示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On instructions from the Security Council:
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.29,1:53:09.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"从速把阿特兰蒂斯毁灭"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Destroy Atlantis fast. "
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.46,1:53:10.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从速是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does "fast" mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.96,1:53:13.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟后进入作战状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Battle stations five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.30,1:53:16.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发射鱼雷?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With torpedoes?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.47,1:53:18.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.30,1:53:20.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是安雅还在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has Anya on there.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.64,1:53:23.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 很抱歉 - 我要去救她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know. I'm sorry. - I have to get her off.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.14,1:53:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 如何? -  可以把Q送来的装备给我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How? - Can I have the equipment Q sent?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.31,1:53:27.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.32,1:53:33.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上把邦德中校的包裹送过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barton. That package for Commander Bond, bring it in quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.49,1:53:38.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 给我一小时 - 那是最高指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I need an hour. - That comes from the top!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.96,1:53:40.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四十分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forty minutes!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.46,1:53:43.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以把我交给军事法庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna get me court-martialed.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.00,1:53:47.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.67,1:53:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.51,1:53:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.66,1:54:50.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上好 我正在恭候你大驾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening, Mr. Bond. I've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.33,1:54:54.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别动 会有升降机下来接你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay where you are. I'll send the elevator down for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.65,1:55:10.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good-bye, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.29,1:55:24.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的想我掉下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did want me to drop in.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.47,1:55:39.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 安雅在哪?  - 喔...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Anya? - Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.41,1:55:43.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,英国特工爱上俄国特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A British agent in love with a Russian agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.65,1:55:45.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想建立缓和关系吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Detente, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.82,1:55:51.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.66,1:56:00.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你已经没有太多时间了 - 你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your time is running out. - Yours too, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.17,1:56:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比你想像中的还要快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And faster than you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.18,1:56:17.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经射了一箭 现在到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shot your bolt. Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.57,1:56:45.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(逃生舱)
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.24,1:58:26.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does that grab you?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.49,1:59:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经超过了五分钟 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're five minutes overdue, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.17,1:59:28.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 斯特龙伯格在哪 - 他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stromberg? - Dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.34,1:59:30.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若还不快逃命 我们也会没命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So are we unless we get out of here fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.41,1:59:31.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞄准目标 发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Match bearings and shoot.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.84,2:01:48.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我低估了斯特龙伯格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I misjudged Stromberg.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.01,2:01:52.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会欣赏52年的香槟的人都不会是大坏蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any man who drinks Dom Perignon '52 can't be all bad.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.95,2:01:59.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任务已经完成 指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mission is over, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.47,2:02:18.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我国的死囚可以有最后的请求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my country, the condemned man is usually allowed a final request.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.61,2:02:19.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我批准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granted.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.65,2:02:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把还些湿衣服脱下来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of these wet things.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.67,2:02:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我们的上司会怎么想?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, James, what would our superiors say?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.48,2:02:55.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不会知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.79,2:03:03.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把船尾的闸门放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lower the stern gate.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.79,2:03:06.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们会患上减压病吗?  - 很快就会知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is there danger of the bends? - We'll soon find out.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.12,2:03:37.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 邦德 - 3X\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 007. - XXX.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.02,2:03:39.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德 你在干吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.49,2:03:44.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是为了国家而做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keeping the British end up, sir.
